    "summary": "Your **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** units gain two benefits:\n\n- They can still **[start an action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions)** after making an **[advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)**.\n- They have **Ceaseless Vigilance**: in your **[Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase)**, such a unit may pick one enemy unit it can see within 12\", which is **nulled** for the rest of the phase; a nulled unit's **detection range** grows by 3\".",
